WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Raw Drive Rush approaches the standing Ryu.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.350
Ryu guards standing medium punch.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.900
The retreat makes Ryu’s throw attempt miss.

4
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.850
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.750
Sprint stop links another standing heavy punch.

6
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.350
Heavy Edge leads into the OD air grab.

7
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.450
Sprint launcher extends the rebound.

8
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.000
Light Edge finishes the punish.

9
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.250
Ryu falls after the completed conversion.
